.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# --- Node -------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.build_cache

# The webpack bundle under dash_emoji_mart/ is COMMITTED on purpose: it is what
# `pip install dash-emoji-mart` ships, and the Docker image builds without Node
# because of it. Do not add dash_emoji_mart/*.js here.

# `dash-generate-components` writes this react-docgen dump next to the bundle.
# Nothing loads it at runtime and it is excluded from the wheel, so it stays out
# of git too.
dash_emoji_mart/metadata.json

# --- Runtime state ----------------------------------------------------------
# dash_emoji_mart.iconify memoises Iconify API responses here for 24h.
.iconify_cache/

# lib/satellite_analytics.py's traffic ledger, plus its per-interval claim
# files. Written on every run, including scripts/smoke_test.py.
satellite_traffic.jsonl
.satellite_traffic.jsonl.*

# --- Local config -----------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.local

# --- Editors / OS -----------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# lib/analytics_tracker.py ledger (TRAFFIC_ANALYTICS_FILE overrides the path).
visitor_analytics.json
visitor_analytics.json.lock

# Session working documents are LOCAL BY CONVENTION, network-wide: sync
# reports, handoffs, and kickoff briefs name hosts, topology, and process.
# Two public fleet repos were caught tracking theirs and clerkhook's staged
# handoff (naming the full satellite inventory) was one push from public
# (2026-08-24). The ignore rule is the enforcement, here and in every fork.
# X402-SYNC-REPORT.md lived in .git/info/exclude until this sync moved it
# here: a per-clone exclude protects ONE checkout and no fork.
X402-SYNC-REPORT.md
HANDOFF-*.md
KICKOFF-*.md

# The .claude/ development kit IS shipped — it is how every fork inherits
# the network's behavioral contract, skills, and settings (the F1 fabric
# build, 2026-08-24). This rule used to be a blanket `.claude/`, which is
# why this repo inherited NOTHING from the template's project instructions.
# Everything else in .claude/ stays local: session scratch, screenshots,
# settings.local.json (per-seat model overrides), vendored iteration copies.
# Allow-list, not blanket ignore — a dir-level ignore cannot be re-included
# beneath, hence the /* form.
.claude/*
!.claude/CLAUDE.md
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/skills/
